<p class="govuk-body">In your court order, this is called a <strong>prohibited activity requirement</strong>. It means you must not take part in certain activities. For example:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li>entering a pub, club or bar</li>
  <li>driving a car</li>
  <li>carrying a knife</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">You may also need to wear a tag.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">It is important to remember that if you do not follow the rules of your order, you could go back to court.</p>
